/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Course 3 · Disciplines of the Faith
   Twelve weeks through the historic spiritual disciplines.

   Prerequisite: The Story of God (which itself follows Foundations).
   For the believer who knows who God is and where the Story goes,
   and now learns how to actually live in this chapter — prayer,
   study, fasting, solitude, simplicity, service, submission,
   confession, sabbath, worship, guidance, celebration.

   Each week's "practice" deliberately points to the platform's
   existing tool for that discipline (/secret-place, /fast, /examen,
   /sabbath, /hours, etc.) — so the course is also a guided tour
   through the practice pages.
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

