      "Christian submission flows from Christ Himself. The Son, fully equal with the Father, freely submitted to the Father's will — through the Incarnation, the public ministry, and supremely in Gethsemane: 'Not my will, but yours.' Christian submission imitates this. It is never the bullied yielding to the bully. It is the strong stepping down voluntarily, in love.",
